  "notes": [
    "companion-drag-handle and companion-resize-handle are played with `press`: their onkeydown maps the arrow keys to onmove / onresize (CompanionDragHandle.svelte:16-37, CompanionResizeHandle.svelte:15-36) -> nudgePosition / nudgeSize (CompanionPanel.svelte:246-266), not gated on isTrusted. Both render only while the panel is not fullscreen, i.e. sidebarState !== 'drawer' (CompanionPanel.svelte:32, 378, 437), which holds at 1280x800. The drag-handle keydown also bubbles to the toolbar's own arrow handler (CompanionPanel.svelte:295-301), so one press moves 40 px; each nudge is followed by its opposite, and snapToEdges (:253) may make the return inexact. Geometry lands in localStorage `companionGeometry` (companion.ts:82), which the runner clears at boot.",
    "companion-error-* (CompanionErrorState.svelte) render only when the guide session creation fails (CompanionPanel.svelte:414-415, companion.ts:383-388); the seeded guide session is created fine, and that fault path is outside this pass."
  ]
